    "title": "Auto Club",
    "description": "Auto Club App improves on-the-go access to trusted Auto Club services including membership, insurance, travel, and roadside assistance. This mobile version also shows members Cheapest Gas and Branch offices nearby.\r\n\r\n<b><u>Currently supported clubs in this app:</u></b>\r\n\u2022 Automobile Club of Southern California\r\n\u2022 AAA Hawaii\r\n\u2022 AAA New Mexico\r\n\u2022 AAA Northern New England\r\n\u2022 AAA Tidewater\r\n\u2022 AAA TX\r\n\u2022 Automobile Club of Missouri\r\n\u2022 AAA Alabama\r\n\u2022 AAA East Central\r\n\u2022 AAA Northeast\r\n\u2022 AAA Washington\r\n\r\n\r\n<b><u>Key features include:</u></b>\r\n\u2022 View membership details and insurance policies\r\n\u2022 Pay bills for membership and insurance\r\n\u2022 Request Roadside assistance\r\n\u2022 Book hotel, flight, or rental cars\r\n\u2022 View upcoming trips\r\n\u2022 Find cheapest gas prices near you\r\n\u2022 Find member branch offices \r\n\u2022 Get an insurance quote for auto, home and other products (not available in all areas)\r\n\u2022 Get instant battery replacement quotes (not available in all areas)\r\n\u2022 Find Approved Auto Repair facilities",
